  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The dataset represents prominent linear (man-made or natural) features including:\n<ul>\n<li>cliffs</li>\n<li>dykes</li>\n<li>fences</li>\n<li>walls</li>\n<li>hedgerows</li>\n<li>feature outlines</li>\n<li>racetrack centre lines</li>\n<li>racetrack edges</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div>We are no longer updating this data. It is best suited for historical research and analysis.</div>\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Additional Documentation</strong></div>\n<div>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Miscellaneous Line - Documentation.docx' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Miscellaneous Line - Documentation (Word)</a><br /></li>\n\t\t<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Miscellaneous%20Line%20-%20Data%20Description.pdf' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Miscellaneous Line - Data Description (PDF)</a><br /></li>\n\t</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div><strong>Status</strong></div>\n\n<div>Completed: production of the data has been completed</div>\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency</strong></div>\n\n<div>Not planned: there are no plans to update the data</div>\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Contact</strong></div>\n\n<div>Ontario Ministry of Natural Resources - Geospatial Ontario, <a href='mailto:geospatial@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>geospatial@ontario.ca </a> </div>"
